# Basket.Api — sistemi Aspire AppHost ile başlat (portlar launchSettings'ten; Aspire dashboard'da doğrula)
# CurrentUser gerektiren uçlar için kullanıcı token'ı gerekir (client_credentials token'ında sub yok):
# WebApp oturumundan bearer'ı kopyalayıp {{token}} yerine yapıştırabilirsin.
@baseAddress = https://localhost:7224
@identity = https://localhost:5001
@productId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afac

### Token al (client_credentials — makine token'ı, scope: basket.read basket.write)
POST {{identity}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=ecommerce.bff&client_secret=webshop-secret&scope=basket.read basket.write

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Sepeti getir (kullanıcının sepeti — basket.read)
GET {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/baskets/user
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sepete ürün ekle (basket.write) — UserId token'dan çözülür, body'de gönderilmez
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/baskets/item
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "productName": "Örnek Ürün",
  "price": 199.90,
  "imageUrl": "/file/images/{{productId}}.png"
}

### Sepet kalemi adedini güncelle (basket.write)
PUT {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/baskets/item/{{productId}}/quantity
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "quantity": 2
}

### Sepet kalemini sil (basket.write)
DELETE {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/baskets/item/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Süresi dolmuş sepeti temizle (basket.write)
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/baskets/purge-expired
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}